WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.148 --> 00:00:05.581
Alright, so you're familiar with the original Star Wars trilogy, as well as Jar Jar Binks and those prequels 

00:00:05.581 --> 00:00:07.292
[Hayden: what have I done] 

00:00:07.292 --> 00:00:09.725
You may have even seen the Star Wars Holiday Special

00:00:09.725 --> 00:00:12.927
[Han: Would you look at Lumpy! He's sure grown huh?]

00:00:12.927 --> 00:00:15.048
[Han: I think his voice is changing]

00:00:15.806 --> 00:00:19.979
So where does Rogue One: A Star Wars Story fit into all this...I'm gonna tell you…

00:00:23.975 --> 00:00:29.418
Let's pick up at episode...let's call it 3 ¾  with Star Wars Rebels.

00:00:29.418 --> 00:00:33.786
It takes place in the latter part of that 19 year gap between Revenge of the Sith and a New Hope.

00:00:33.786 --> 00:00:39.396
The show lays the foundation of the Rebel Alliance, focusing on a team similar to Rogue One’s outmatched heroes.

00:00:39.461 --> 00:00:45.796
They put up a good fight against the Empire, but like a bunch of padawans versus Emo-Anakin, they don’t stand a chance.

00:00:45.796 --> 00:00:47.841
[Hayden turns on saber]

00:00:47.841 --> 00:00:54.262
See, the Empire had much bigger plans like building a super weapon space station capable of wiping out entire planets.

00:00:54.262 --> 00:01:01.627
The Death Star had been under construction since The Clone Wars, but it was missing a fairly important feature… the whole planet destroying laser part

00:01:01.627 --> 00:01:05.601
In retrospect, they also could have spent a little more time designing those exhaust ports.

00:01:05.601 --> 00:01:10.276
[Luke fires missiles into Death Star]

00:01:10.276 --> 00:01:14.485
Which brings us up to the events of Rogue Once prequel novel, Catalyst.

00:01:14.485 --> 00:01:21.615
The book focuses on Jyn Erso’s father and super talented scientist Galen as well as Orson Krennic, an up and coming Imperial lieutenant.

00:01:21.615 --> 00:01:25.472
 Galen’s specialty is generating power through the use of kyber crystals.

00:01:25.472 --> 00:01:28.804
Think of Kyber crystals kinda like Duracells for lightsabers.

00:01:28.804 --> 00:01:30.733
[Luke turns on lightsaber]

00:01:30.733 --> 00:01:33.329
Now imagine what you can build if you had a whole bunch of these crystals...

00:01:33.329 --> 00:01:40.853
So good ol Krennic, eager to put a cherry on top of the Death Star sundae, brings Galen to Coruscant to work on a sustainable energy source.

00:01:40.853 --> 00:01:41.720
Wink Wink

00:01:41.720 --> 00:01:47.059
What Galen doesn’t know, he’s actually helping Krennic develop the weapons tech for the space station.

00:01:47.059 --> 00:01:55.304
Being such a great guy, Krennic supplies Galen with piles of kyber crystals. But unbeknownst to Galen these were all taken from the lightsabers of dead Jedi.

00:01:55.304 --> 00:01:57.457
Total dick move right?

00:01:57.457 --> 00:02:00.310
when Galen finds out, he's not too happy

00:02:00.310 --> 00:02:06.178
He and his family escape from Coruscant with the help of Saw Gerrerra, who’s the leader of a resistance group called the Partisans. 

00:02:06.178 --> 00:02:11.453
So when we catch up to Saw in Rogue One, we can assume that Jyn considers him a friend.

00:02:11.453 --> 00:02:13.553
[Saw: The world is coming undone] 

00:02:13.553 --> 00:02:19.690
Speaking of Jyn - she’s all grown up, a quite rebellious badass with a particular grudge against the Empire. 

00:02:19.690 --> 00:02:23.350
 She’s also the perfect person to lead a mission to steal the Death Star’s secret plans. 

00:02:23.350 --> 00:02:28.087
From Episode Four, we know that her team is successful in getting the Death Star plans to the Alliance.

00:02:28.087 --> 00:02:29.918
but we don’t know who will make it out alive.

00:02:31.587 --> 00:02:33.686
Do you have any theories on how the film will end?

00:02:33.686 --> 00:02:38.208
Let us know in the comments and for all your film, TV and comic book needs keep it here on GameSpot Universe.

